                "Phase 1 provides ~9.5 days of net crude imports (total national commercial + strategic cover is ~74–90 days).",
                "Phase 2 expansion adds 6.5 MMT capacity at Chandikhol (Odisha, 4.0 MT) and Padur (Karnataka, 2.5 MT).",
                "National Critical Minerals Strategy recommends building strategic mineral stockpiles (Lithium, Cobalt, REEs, Tantalum)."
